# Wireframe: IssueDetailPage

## Purpose & Flow Context

Full issue view with metadata, description, comments, and action controls. Entry: click IssueCard on IssuesPage, or direct URL `/issues/:id`. Exit: back button → IssuesPage, or Edit → IssueFormModal, or Delete → ConfirmDeleteDialog.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `👤` | User / mention |
| `[#]` | Badge | `💬N` | N comments |

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column. App-shell shared (Header + Sidebar). Content split into two columns: main (8 cols) + sidebar meta (4 cols).

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Issue title + identifier — what is this?
2. Metadata bar — status, priority, assignee
3. Description — the body
4. Comments — discussion

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Header: Logo] [Search] [Notifs] [Avatar] [Theme]               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  +-----------+  +-----8 cols------+  +----4 cols----+           |
|  | [Sidebar] |  | [← Back]        |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |                  |  | [#Status]    |           |
|  |           |  |  h1: Fix login   |  | [#Priority]  |           |
|  |           |  |  redirect        |  |              |           |
|  | [#Issues] |  |  ENG-123         |  | 👤 Assignee  |           |
|  | Projects  |  |                  |  | Name          |           |
|  | Cycles    |  |  [Edit] [Delete] |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  ─────────────    |  | Labels:      |           |
|  |           |  |                  |  | [#bug] [#ui] |           |
|  |           |  |  Description     |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  ─────────────    |  | 📅 Created   |           |
|  |           |  |  When the user   |  | Jul 15, 2026 |           |
|  |           |  |  logs in with    |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  valid creds...  |  | 📅 Updated   |           |
|  |           |  |                  |  | Jul 20, 2026 |           |
|  |           |  |  ─────────────    |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  Comments (3)    |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  ─────────────    |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  👤 Juan C.      |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  2h ago          |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  I think the     |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  issue is in     |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  the interceptor |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |                  |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  ─────────────    |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  Add a comment...|  |              |           |
|  |           |  |  [Cancel] [Save] |  |              |           |
|  |           |  |                  |  |              |           |
|  +-----------+  +------------------+  +--------------+           |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| "Back" button | Button (ghost) | `←` icon, navigates to `/issues` | — |
| "Edit" button | Button (ghost) | Opens IssueFormModal in edit mode | — |
| "Delete" button | Button (danger) | Opens ConfirmDeleteDialog | — |
| Status badge | Badge | Read-only display on sidebar | — |
| Priority badge | Badge | Read-only display | — |
| Assignee | Avatar (md) + name | Read-only | Unassigned → "Unassigned" text |
| Labels | Badge | Each label as a pill | No labels → section hidden |
| Comment list | — | Chronological, newest at top | No comments → "No comments yet" |
| CommentForm | — | Textarea + Cancel/Save buttons | Empty submit disabled |

## Data Display

Two-column layout: main column (8/12) for title, description, comments; sidebar (4/12) for metadata. Description uses rendered markdown. Comments are flat list, not threaded (MVP).

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| h1 | Issue title — what needs to be done | Editable in edit mode |
| Identifier | Reference ID — for search, linking | Monospace |
| "Back" | Navigate up to list | Arrow icon + text |
| "Edit" | Modify issue fields | — |
| "Delete" | Irreversible removal | Danger variant warns user |
| "Add a comment…" | Placeholder for comment input | Not a label |
| "No comments yet" | Empty comment state | — |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Layout shown above with full issue data, comments, and metadata sidebar.

### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [← Back]                                                        |
|                                                                    |
|  [======================= skeleton line =======================]  |
|  [============== skeleton line ============]                     |
|                                                                    |
|  [======= skeleton ======]  [======== skeleton ==========]       |
|  [======= skeleton ======]                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Skeleton mirrors the two-column layout with title bar, description block, and metadata placeholder.

### Empty / Not Found

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                      Issue not found                             |
|                      This issue may have been deleted or          |
|                      you don't have access.                      |
|                      [ Back to Issues ]                          |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

Inline banner replacing the detail area (not full page):
```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [⚠] Could not load this issue. [ Retry ]                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Two-column layout as shown |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Metadata sidebar moves below description; comments remain below |
| Mobile (<768px) | Single column; metadata sections as collapse-able accordion |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `nav`, `main` (detail content), `aside` (metadata) |
| Heading order | `h1` (issue title) → `h2` ("Description", "Comments") |
| Reading / Focus order | Back → title → metadata → description → comments → comment form |
| Accessible names | Back button `aria-label="Back to issues"`; Edit/Delete have text labels |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through metadata, description, comments, form |
| Target size | All interactive elements ≥24×24 px |
| Non-color intent | Status + priority use text + color badges |
